osls: 1
id: "9.1.6-wide"
name: "9.1.6 (wide)"
description: "9.1.6 home immersive layout with front wides (16 ch): 7.1.4 + front wides (Lw/Rw) + top-middle (Ltm/Rtm). All positions per ITU-R BS.2051 (not a named ITU system). NOTE: IAMF's expanded 9.1.6 uses a different speaker set (centre-fill FLc/FRc) and is a separate layout file."
